{"2684010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Laura Up", "steam_appid": 2684010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2781040], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Laura Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A challenging precision platformer where every jump counts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/e32410b9d2a3e53c6bf87d17e488966d.apng?t=1777210111\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/e32410b9d2a3e53c6bf87d17e488966d.poster.avif?t=1777210111\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Petting the dog\" width=636 height=495 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yes, you can pet the dog.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/db02fd02fe6c70cf8696a8cc55eee410.poster.avif?t=1777210111\" aria-label=\"Really long hat\" width=964 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/db02fd02fe6c70cf8696a8cc55eee410.webm?t=1777210111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/db02fd02fe6c70cf8696a8cc55eee410.mp4?t=1777210111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>A really long hat... because why not?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/03fdb6c22fea51477184ccfeab2f4864.poster.avif?t=1777210111\" aria-label=\"Aquarium Hat\" width=294 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/03fdb6c22fea51477184ccfeab2f4864.webm?t=1777210111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An aquarium hat. Completely normal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Laura Up is a <strong>precision platformer</strong> inspired by classic retro games and modern hard platformers. Climb your way through carefully designed levels filled with tight jumps, tricky obstacles, and unforgiving challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your timing, improve your skill, and push your limits in a game built for players who enjoy difficulty and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tight, responsive controls designed for <strong>hardcore platforming</strong>. Every movement matters, and success depends entirely on your execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Challenge (Rage Game Experience)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy <strong>difficult platformers</strong> and &quot;rage games&quot;, this is for you. Expect to fail, retry, and improve with every attempt. Progress is earned through persistence and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo or Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the climb alone or team up in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong>. Coordinate with a friend and overcome obstacles together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenging <strong>precision platformer</strong> gameplay  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Smooth and responsive controls  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Retro-inspired pixel art visuals  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Co-op platformer</strong> mode with friends  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fun interactive moments and secrets  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Skill-based progression and level design  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast retries to keep you in the action  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Reach the Top?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most persistent players will overcome every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Super Laura Up to your wishlist and prepare for a true platforming challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keywords:</strong> precision platformer, hard platformer, difficult platformer, rage game, retro platformer, co-op platformer, indie platformer, skill-based platformer</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Laura Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A challenging precision platformer where every jump counts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/e32410b9d2a3e53c6bf87d17e488966d.apng?t=1777210111\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684010/extras/e32410b9d2a3e53c6bf87d17e48896